      "created_at": "2026-03-13T18:20:26.419Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/waveform\">@waveform</a></p>\n<p>I had an experience where i have achieved such a situation to handle child items based on parent and Grand Parent working with <strong>Product Bundle</strong>.</p>\n<p>Product Bundle can compose and categories items into Grand Parent, parent and child items and populate them on item tables along with bundle table which you can easily use and configure for print formats as following;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/2/c2f8695f15a8929fa19c2108bf8cbafe0e85374b.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/c2f8695f15a8929fa19c2108bf8cbafe0e85374b\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/2/c2f8695f15a8929fa19c2108bf8cbafe0e85374b_2_690x381.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"rOMQCkoRw7KWVGnmLDiNer6ER2X\" width=\"690\" height=\"381\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/2/c2f8695f15a8929fa19c2108bf8cbafe0e85374b_2_690x381.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/2/c2f8695f15a8929fa19c2108bf8cbafe0e85374b_2_1035x571.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/2/c2f8695f15a8929fa19c2108bf8cbafe0e85374b.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F0EEE9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1347×744 37.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
